diff --git a/CHANGELOG b/CHANGELOG
index 63076fa..3b89d85 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG
+++ b/CHANGELOG
@@ -15,6 +15,17 @@ Bug Fixes
 
 * Fix statement splitting (issue845).
 * Fix a late-binding closure bug in `TokenList.token_not_matching`.
+* Fix `Function.get_window()` crashing for functions without OVER clause.
+* Fix Python/PHP output formats: escape backslashes, newlines and (PHP) `$`,
+  and don't lose changes made by other filters inside nested groups.
+* Fix truncate_strings splitting escape sequences, producing invalid SQL.
+* Fix strip_semicolon not stripping a semicolon followed by a comment.
+* Fix reindent splitting on partial keyword matches (FOR, OFFSET, ...).
+* Fix quadratic lexing time for inputs with unterminated block comments.
+* Accept binary file-like objects in parsestream, decode non-UTF-8 bytes as
+  latin-1 instead of unicode-escape.
+* CLI: don't truncate files on formatting errors with --in-place, report
+  decode errors, parse --comma_first/--compact boolean values correctly.
 
 
 Release 0.5.5 (Dec 19, 2025)
